Open the PIN page for the device that waits.

Without ?uniqueid= the page used a fixed id, which Moonlight on Android sends
and Moonlight on a computer does not, so a computer's PIN was refused. The page
and /submit-pin now use the device that waits for its PIN.

Not upstream yet.

